 lurking within, they begin to unravel the ancient mystery of the ship's disappearance and the dark secrets it still guards.", "summary": "Enter the Chaos-infested Caligari Sector and purge the unclean with the most powerful agents of the Imperium of Man.\nWarhammer 40,000: Inquisitor - Martyr is a grim Action-RPG featuring multiple classes of the Inquisition who will carry out the Emperor' will in the darkest reaches of the Imperium!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/warhammer-40000-inquisitor-martyr", "videos": [{"id": 9654, "name": "Gamescom 2016 Trailer", "video_id": "7GstwJ7tl7g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7GstwJ7tl7g", "title": "Warhammer 40,000: Inquisitor - Martyr - Gamescom 2016 Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7GstwJ7tl7g/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 8701, "name": "E3 2016 Trailer", "video_id": "vDPfpVKFGh8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vDPfpVKFGh8", "title": "Warhammer 40,000: Inquisitor - Martyr - E3 2016 Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vDPfpVKFGh8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 17727, "name": "Intro Trailer", "video_id": "BcjYdVlApDw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BcjYdVlApDw", "title": "Warhammer 40,000: Inquisitor - Martyr - Intro Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BcjYdVlApDw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 4713, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "qZKYY94a108", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qZKYY94a108", "title": "Warhammer 40,000: Inquisitor - Martyr - Teaser (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qZKYY94a108/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 7998, "name": "Destruction Trailer", "video_id": "7-wKQQQVuc0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7-wKQQQVuc0", "title": "Warhammer 40,000: Inquisitor - Martyr - Destruction Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7-wKQQQVuc0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 11410, "name": "Open world Trailer", "video_id": "Ac9QgJUDB_s", "url": "